alue of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 43 of them, more than any other pair. In 2026 so far, February to March came in at 14% of normal on the middle of the grids, and March to April at 31%. Grid 24122 had its driest year in 2012 at 52% of normal.</p>"}
